OL,3,GNEWSALocal businesses lose confidence
OL,4,Aover permit delays
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere is a lack of confidence from
OL,7,Flocal businesses that the Population
OL,8,FManagement Service can reduce the
OL,9,Fbacklog of permit applications.
OL,11,FIt follows an update from the Committee
OL,12,Ffor Home Affairs which said there were
OL,13,Fmore than 4,200 pending population
OL,14,Fmanagement applications.
OL,16,FAnthony Hansen, runs Hansen's coffee
OL,17,Fand sandwich bars in Guernsey and said
OL,18,Fin the last 20 years of being in
OL,19,Fbusiness he had "never ever experienced
OL,20,Fsuch dire circumstances."
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
