OL,3,GNEWSALocal businesses lose confidence
OL,4,Aover permit delays
OL,5,
OL,6,FCommittee president, Deputy Mark
OL,7,FLeadbeater said: "It is important that
OL,8,Fthere is clarity around exactly where
OL,9,Fand how we are going to rebuild
OL,10,Fconfidence in the system."
